      "description": "Bicycle-blue contained action with a 2px hard edge that collapses on press.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">Study all due · 7</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{background:#0d3b8f;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:8px;padding:8.8px 20px;font-family:Barlow,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.01em;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 2px 0 #082560;transition:transform .06s ease,box-shadow .06s ease,background-color .15s}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:#134aad}.ds-btn-primary:active{transform:translateY(2px);box-shadow:0 0 0 #082560}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0d3b8f;outline-offset:2px}.ds-btn-primary:disabled{background:#a9bfa5;color:#3e5a47;box-shadow:none}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Outlined Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-outlined",
      "description": "Secondary action on the table: 1.5px stroke in table text, hover wash.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-outlined\">Back to deck</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-outlined{background:transparent;color:#14301f;border:1.5px solid #14301f;border-radius:8px;padding:8.8px 16px;font-family:Barlow,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.01em;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s}.ds-btn-outlined:hover{background:rgba(20,48,31,0.06)}.ds-btn-outlined:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0d3b8f;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-text",
      "description": "Quiet table-side action (back, undo, example deck): muted text that darkens on hover.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-text\">Example deck</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-text{background:transparent;color:#3e5a47;border:none;border-radius:8px;padding:4px 10px;font-family:Barlow,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.01em;cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s}.ds-btn-text:hover{color:#14301f}.ds-btn-text:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0d3b8f;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input-field",
      "description": "Card-stock input with a 1.5px card-rule outline; focus turns the outline Bicycle Blue.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span>Deck name</span><input class=\"ds-input\" value=\"Organic chemistry\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-family:Barlow,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-field span{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:#5f5f5f}.ds-input{background:#faf8f3;color:#161616;border:1.5px solid #dcd8cf;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;caret-color:#0d3b8f;outline:none;transition:border-color .15s}.ds-input::placeholder{color:#5f5f5f}.ds-input:hover{border-color:#5f5f5f}.ds-input:focus{border-color:#0d3b8f}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Grade Chips",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-grade",
      "description": "The four poker chips that grade a card: Again red, Hard orange, Good green, Easy blue; 8 white rim dashes, hard edge, 3px press.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chip-row\"><label><button class=\"ds-chip\" style=\"background:#c8102e;--edge:#7f0a1d\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"44\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.92)\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-dasharray=\"17.3 17.3\" stroke-dashoffset=\"8.6\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"33\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.55)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg><span>1</span></button>Again</label><label><button class=\"ds-chip\" style=\"background:#d97b12;--edge:#8a4c08\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"44\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.92)\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-dasharray=\"17.3 17.3\" stroke-dashoffset=\"8.6\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"33\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.55)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg><span>2</span></button>Hard</label><label><button class=\"ds-chip\" style=\"background:#1f8a4c;--edge:#125430\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"44\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.92)\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-dasharray=\"17.3 17.3\" stroke-dashoffset=\"8.6\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"33\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.55)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg><span>3</span></button>Good</label><label><button class=\"ds-chip\" style=\"background:#0d3b8f;--edge:#082560\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"44\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.92)\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-dasharray=\"17.3 17.3\" stroke-dashoffset=\"8.6\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"33\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.55)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg><span>4</span></button>Easy</label></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;border:none;padding:0;color:#fff;font-family:\"Barlow Condensed\",\"Barlow\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:27px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 3px 0 var(--edge),0 6px 10px -4px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);transition:transform .06s ease,box-shadow .06s ease,filter .12s}.ds-chip:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}.ds-chip:active{transform:translateY(3px);box-shadow:0 0 0 var(--edge),0 2px 4px -2px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0d3b8f;outline-offset:2px}.ds-chip span{position:relative}.ds-chip-row{display:flex;gap:28px;justify-content:center;font-family:Barlow,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-chip-row label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#14301f}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Due Badge Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-badge",
      "description": "A 34px Again-red chip overhanging a deck corner with the due count.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-badge\" style=\"background:#c8102e;--edge:#7f0a1d\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"44\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.92)\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-dasharray=\"17.3 17.3\" stroke-dashoffset=\"8.6\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"33\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.55)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg><span>6</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;color:#fff;font-family:\"Barlow Condensed\",\"Barlow\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;line-height:1;box-shadow:0 3px 0 var(--edge),0 6px 10px -4px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)}.ds-badge span{position:relative}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Card Face",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card-face",
      "description": "A face-up study card: card stock, corner indices (bottom-right rotated 180deg), centered balanced question, chapter foot.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-face\"><div class=\"ds-index ds-index-tl\">4</div><p class=\"ds-question\">What is the capital of Mongolia?</p><div class=\"ds-foot\">Chapter 2: Asia</div><div class=\"ds-index ds-index-br\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-face{position:relative;width:240px;aspect-ratio:63/88;background:#faf8f3;color:#161616;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.12),0 8px 18px -6px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);padding:48px 26px 44px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:Barlow,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-index{position:absolute;font-family:\"Barlow Condensed\",\"Barlow\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:28px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;user-select:none}.ds-index-tl{top:12px;left:14px}.ds-index-br{bottom:12px;right:14px;transform:rotate(180deg)}.ds-question{margin:0;font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.005em;text-align:center;text-wrap:balance}.ds-foot{position:absolute;bottom:16px;left:52px;right:52px;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;color:#5f5f5f;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Deck Back",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card-back",
      "description": "A face-down deck on the table: card stock, printed Bicycle frame with a procedural lattice, name ribbon; lifts and tilts on hover.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-back\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 63 88\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><pattern id=\"ds-lat\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"scale(0.3125) rotate(45)\"><path d=\"M0 5 L5 0 L10 5 L5 10 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0d3b8f\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"5\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"#0d3b8f\"/></pattern></defs><rect width=\"63\" height=\"88\" rx=\"2.5\" fill=\"#0d3b8f\"/><rect x=\"1.6\" y=\"1.6\" width=\"59.8\" height=\"84.8\" rx=\"1.6\" fill=\"#fff\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"57\" height=\"82\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"url(#ds-lat)\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"57\" height=\"82\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0d3b8f\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/></svg><div class=\"ds-ribbon\"><strong>Organic chemistry</strong><small>9 cards</small></div></button>",
      "css": ".ds-back{position:relative;display:block;width:180px;aspect-ratio:63/88;padding:0;border:none;background:#faf8f3;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.12),0 8px 18px -6px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);transition:transform .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease}.ds-back svg{position:absolute;inset:6%;width:88%;height:88%;display:block}.ds-back:hover{transform:translateY(-4px) rotate(-1deg);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.12),0 14px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)}.ds-back:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0d3b8f;outline-offset:2px}.ds-ribbon{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);background:#faf8f3;color:#161616;padding:8px 12px;border-top:1.5px solid #dcd8cf;border-bottom:1.5px solid #dcd8cf;font-family:Barlow,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-ribbon strong{display:block;font-family:\"Barlow Condensed\",\"Barlow\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:.01em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}.ds-ribbon small{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#5f5f5f;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shell Header",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "",
      "description": "The only navigation: 56px row, brand left, controls and theme toggle right.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-shell\"><a class=\"ds-brand\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"11\" y=\"7\" width=\"34\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#0d3b8f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" transform=\"rotate(-14 28 31)\"/><rect x=\"21\" y=\"14\" width=\"34\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#161616\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M40 22 L32 38 h6 L34 50 L46 32 h-6 Z\" fill=\"#c8102e\"/></svg>flashmd</a><div class=\"ds-shell-right\"><button class=\"ds-btn-text\">Example deck</button><button class=\"ds-iconbtn\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark table\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8z\"/></svg></button></div></header>",
      "css": ".ds-shell{height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 24px;background:#c9dbc5;color:#14301f;font-family:Barlow,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;font-family:\"Barlow Condensed\",\"Barlow\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1}.ds-brand svg{transition:transform .18s ease}.ds-brand:hover svg{transform:rotate(-6deg)}.ds-shell-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.ds-btn-text{background:transparent;color:#3e5a47;border:none;border-radius:8px;padding:4px 10px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}.ds-btn-text:hover{color:#14301f}.ds-iconbtn{display:inline-flex;padding:5px;border:none;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:#3e5a47;cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s,background-color .15s}.ds-iconbtn:hover{color:#14301f;background:rgba(20,48,31,0.06)}.ds-iconbtn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0d3b8f;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Progress Keys",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "",
      "description": "One 6px key per card along the top edge; unanswered in table rule, current in table text, answered lit in grade ink.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-keys\"><i style=\"background:#1f8a4c\"></i><i style=\"background:#c8102e\"></i><i style=\"background:#0d3b8f\"></i><i style=\"background:#d97b12\"></i><i style=\"background:#14301f\"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>",
      "css": ".ds-keys{display:flex;gap:3px;height:6px;width:320px;padding:0 0}.ds-keys i{flex:1;min-width:0;border-radius:4px;background:#a9bfa5;transition:background-color .2s ease}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Card Table",
    "overview": "A deck is a deck. flashmd refuses the category default (a centered card on a neutral app surface, four colored buttons, a list of decks with progress bars) and instead puts real playing cards on a real table. There are two tables, a pale daylight baize and a deep night baize, and exactly one card stock: near-white paper that stays near-white in both themes and is the light source of every screen. Ink printed on a card is near-black regardless of theme; the table's own text shifts with the table.\n\nColor is scarce and rule-bound. Bicycle blue and red carry deck backs, corner indices, and primary actions. A single color law governs grading: Again is red, Hard is orange, Good is green, Easy is blue, and a grade wears the same color everywhere it appears (chips, progress keys, due badges, results piles, accuracy readouts). No gold, no neon, no gradients, no glass, no glow. Depth is physical: a card casts a soft drop on the baize, a chip has a thick edge that collapses when pressed.\n\nDensity is generous on the table and tight on the card. Readouts live in the four corners of a view; the center belongs to the cards. Motion is dealing-grammar only: a card drops in, a card flips about its vertical axis, chips slide up after the flip, a press pushes a chip into the table.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Two baize tables (day / night), one unchanging card stock",
      "Card ink is always near-black; table text follows the theme",
      "Bicycle blue / red for backs, indices, primary actions; the grade law for everything graded",
      "Poker-card geometry: 63:88 ratio, 12px corners, corner indices top-left and rotated bottom-right",
      "Poker chips (round, white rim dashes, thick edge) as the only grade control, counter, and badge",
      "Procedural card backs derived from the deck name",
      "Barlow for UI, Barlow Condensed for indices and numerals, system mono for code"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Stock Rule",
        "body": "Card stock is `#faf8f3` on both tables and its ink is `#161616` on both tables. A theme change recolors the table, never the cards.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Table Text Rule",
        "body": "Accent-colored text on the baize uses the table-tinted variants (`*-blue-text`, `*-red-text`, `*-good-text`, `*-hard-text`); the raw inks are for stock and chips only.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Rank Rule",
        "body": "Any number that counts something (index, n/N, due, score, streak, chapter number) is Barlow Condensed 700 with `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`. Body Barlow never carries a headline numeral.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Sentence Case Rule",
        "body": "Buttons and labels are sentence case at 600 with 0.01em tracking. No uppercase eyebrows, no kickers.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Edge Is The Press Rule",
        "body": "Chips and primary buttons show depth as a hard bottom edge in their own darker ink. Pressing moves the object down by exactly the edge height and the edge disappears. The edge is never a decorative offset on a card or a container.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Stock Casts, The Table Does Not Rule",
        "body": "Only card stock (and chips on it) casts a shadow. Nothing on the baize itself (buttons text/outlined, readouts, progress keys) has a shadow.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** put every face-up surface on card stock (`#faf8f3`) with near-black ink, in both themes.",
      "**Do** color any grade or accuracy with the Grade Law inks and the matching `-edge` for chips.",
      "**Do** set every count in Barlow Condensed 700 with tabular numerals.",
      "**Do** use the poker chip for anything round and pressable or countable; the 8-dash rim is part of the component.",
      "**Do** keep cards at 63:88 with 12px corners, and give the bottom-right index a 180 degree turn.",
      "**Do** keep readouts in the corners of a view and the cards in the center.",
      "**Do** use the table-tinted `*-text` variants for accent text on the baize."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** use gold, neon, gradients, glass, blur or glow anywhere.",
      "**Don't** tint card stock or card ink with the theme; only the table changes.",
      "**Don't** invent a fifth grade color or re-map a grade's color per screen.",
      "**Don't** put a shadow on anything that is not card stock or a chip; text and outlined buttons stay flat on the table.",
      "**Don't** use hard offset edges on cards or containers; the edge belongs to chips and primary buttons only, and it collapses on press.",
      "**Don't** add uppercase eyebrows, kickers, or tracked labels; buttons are sentence case.",
      "**Don't** add ripple, elevation, or partial reveal to the flip; one gesture turns the whole card."
    ]
  }
}